        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia #47 Modern Curved Stainless Steel Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia #47 Stainless Steel Lever features a gentle outward projecting curved design for that extra level of style. Every piece is extra durable, made from premium grade stainless steel coupled with interior components that prove worthy of Omnia's exceptional quality standards. The Omnia 47 Lever is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. The Modern Curved Stainless Steel Lever has a satin stainless steel finish. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-72866-sm.jpg?v=1704354602\" width=\"297\" height=\"179\" border=\"0\" alt=\"OMN 47 Lever Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Modern Curved Stainless Steel Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Residential and Commercial Doors</li>\r\n<li>Fits most standard door cut outs</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia #47 Modern Curved Stainless Steel Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel Finish</b></li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Diameter (thickness): 11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-7/16\"</li> \r\n<li>Rose Projection: 1/2\"</li> \r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\" and 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch: 28 Degrees Retraction </li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard 2-1/8\" inch door bore</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on one side of the door. Package Includes: 1 lever, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 rosettes, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, solid spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, slit spindle, and mounting screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Modern Curved Stainless Steel Door Lever Set",
                "description": "The Omnia #47 Stainless Steel Lever features a gentle outward projecting curved design for that extra level of style. Every piece is extra durable, made from premium grade stainless steel coupled with interior components that prove worthy of Omnia's exceptional quality standards. The Omnia 47 Lever is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. The Modern Curved Stainless Steel Lever has a satin stainless steel finish. \r\n",
                "keywords": "OMN-47 Omnia #47 Modern Curved Stainless Steel Door Levers, Curved Stainless Steel Door Lever Sets, Omnia #47 designer Stainless Steel Leverset,  contemporary Stainless Steel Leversets,  Omnia  #47 stainless levers, stainless steel handle  lever set, contemporary door hardware, stainless door locks, contemporary stainless steel locks, omnia designer door hardware, modern door levers,"
